{"id": "g3_count_overlapping_half_open_slot_pairs", "signature": "solve(slots)", "statement": "`slots` is a list of [start, end] pairs of integers describing HALF-OPEN intervals [start, end), so end is not included. Pairs with start >= end are empty and are ignored. Return the number of unordered pairs of different non-empty entries (different list positions; two identical entries form a pair) whose intervals share at least one time point. Touching intervals such as [1, 3) and [3, 5) do not overlap. Return 0 for an empty list or when no two non-empty intervals overlap.", "tests": [{"args": [[]], "expected": 0}, {"args": [[[1, 3], [3, 5]]], "expected": 0}, {"args": [[[1, 4], [2, 3]]], "expected": 1}, {"args": [[[0, 0], [0, 5]]], "expected": 0}, {"args": [[[1, 3], [1, 3], [1, 3]]], "expected": 3}, {"args": [[[5, 2], [1, 3]]], "expected": 0}, {"args": [[[0, 10], [2, 4], [3, 5], [9, 20]]], "expected": 4}, {"args": [[[1, 2], [2, 3], [3, 4]]], "expected": 0}, {"args": [[[-5, -1], [-3, 0]]], "expected": 1}, {"args": [[[0, 6], [0, 6], [5, 6], [6, 7]]], "expected": 3}, {"args": [[[14, 5], [1, 11], [9, -2], [-1, 10], [13, -4]]], "expected": 1}, {"args": [[[3, -2], [8, 1], [14, 6], [14, 3], [8, 2], [7, -3]]], "expected": 0}, {"args": [[[0, -3], [10, -5]]], "expected": 0}, {"args": [[[6, 14]]], "expected": 0}, {"args": [[[7, 4], [4, 9], [8, 12], [-4, 10], [8, -2]]], "expected": 3}, {"args": [[[-5, 10], [10, 1], [-5, 3], [11, 15], [4, 2], [2, 3], [4, 12]]], "expected": 5}, {"args": [[[5, -3], [0, 2], [5, 4], [15, -5]]], "expected": 0}], "facts": [["arg", "slots", "interval_list"], ["iterate", "slots"], ["ask", "overlap_pairs"], ["interval_ends", "half_open"], ["size", "slots", "tiny"]], "deps": {"schema": ["interval_scan"], "uses": ["interval_overlapping_pairs"], "solution_sha256": "eb9e5816a43c7421f677e92a4eba2cd9e8892c9bc2028366816c563f051d624e", "reference_sha256": "f8c6979c6e3ca11f5bdde7bd3b5648bbe06e42d42e4ee068624ecf1fd2c15342"}}